      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;”ln -s”&lt;/strong&gt; komutunu kullanarak bir dosyanın kısayolunu yaratabilirsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ ln -s /media/Yedek /home/Gokhan/Desktop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ ln -s /media/Film /home/Gokhan/Desktop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“cp”&lt;/strong&gt; komutu ile bir dosyayı kopyalayabilirsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
